# Constructs the 30-file upstream corpus never exercises: points, lines,
# object name, the display toggles, level of detail, the texture map
# library, "off" smoothing/merging groups, call/csh, and the ctech/stech
# forms the corpus leaves untried (cspace, curv, cparmb).
o widget

v 0.0 0.0 0.0
v 1.0 0.0 0.0
v 1.0 1.0 0.0

p 1 2 3

l 1 2
l 1/1 2/2

bevel on
bevel off
c_interp on
c_interp off
d_interp on
d_interp off

lod 3

maplib bump.map spec.map
usemap tiles
usemap off

s off
mg off

ctech cspace 0.5
ctech curv 0.1 5.0
stech cparmb 2.0
stech cspace 0.5

call other.obj arg1 arg2
csh backup - nightly
